{
 "file": "Emuqu/Sources/Assistant/Providers/OpenAICompatibleStreamer.swift",
 "hash": "f984e0baf7aafc35",
 "role": "Shared OpenAI Chat Completions client for OpenAI, Grok and DeepSeek: endpoints, request body shapes, message building with cache-marker split, SSE parse with tool_call accumulation (a reply is complete only after [DONE] or a finish_reason; a cut stream reports a dropped connection, a malformed event or mid-stream error throws, length ends with '…', content_filter is a blocked reply, cut or unparseable tool arguments never run), usage mapping and the non-2xx mapping through ProviderHTTP.statusFailure (a 400 envelope naming param model is modelUnavailable, another 400 envelope its message). Opens the stream through ProviderHTTP.openStream. Also declares OpenAICompatibleProvider, whose extension supplies send for OpenAI, Grok and DeepSeek.",
 "types": [
  "OpenAICompatibleStreamer: enum — namespace",
  "Endpoint: enum — parsed endpoint URLs",
  "Reasoning: enum — modelDefault/effortNone/thinkingDisabled",
  "StreamCall: struct — one call's inputs",
  "MessageShape: enum — Encodable chat message variants",
  "OutgoingToolCall/OutgoingTool/RequestBody/PendingToolCall/StreamState: structs — wire/accumulator shapes",
  "OpenAICompatibleProvider: protocol (KeyedCloudProvider) — requires static endpoint and reasoning",
  "OpenAICompatibleProvider: extension — send through OpenAICompatibleStreamer.send"
 ],
